*> ********************************************************
*> PROGRAM : INT0023
*> PURPOSE : INTEREST TIERS RULES
*> AUTHOR  : J.K.
*> CHANGE LOG:
*>   1992-06-13 ORIGINAL VERSION
*>   2009-11-09 THRESHOLDS UPDATED PER AUDIT REQ 845
*> RUN FROM JCL JOB INTNIGHT STEP010
*> ********************************************************
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. INT0023.
ENVIRONMENT DIVISION.
CONFIGURATION SECTION.
SOURCE-COMPUTER. IBM-370.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
01 IN-RECORD.
    *> CUSTOMER AGE IN YEARS
    05 CUSTOMER-AGE       PIC 9(3).
    *> CURRENT LEDGER BALANCE
    05 LEDGER-BAL         PIC 9(9)V99.
    *> ACCOUNT TYPE S=SAVINGS C=CHECKING P=PREMIUM G=GOLD B=BUSINESS F=FIXED
    05 ACCT-TYP           PIC X.
    05 BASE-INT-RATE      PIC 9V9999.
01 WS-RESULTS.
    *> RATE AFTER BONUS
    05 BONUS-RATE         PIC 9V9999 VALUE ZERO.
PROCEDURE DIVISION.
MAINLINE.
    ACCEPT IN-RECORD
    PERFORM SENIOR-BONUS
    DISPLAY "BONUS-RATE=" BONUS-RATE
    STOP RUN.
SENIOR-BONUS.
    *> SENIOR SAVER BONUS
    IF CUSTOMER-AGE >= 55 AND LEDGER-BAL >= 25000
        COMPUTE BONUS-RATE ROUNDED = BASE-INT-RATE + 0.0050
    ELSE
        MOVE BASE-INT-RATE TO BONUS-RATE
    END-IF.
